{title: Mai Ye Sochkar Uske Dar Se}
{artist: Mohammed Rafi Madan Mohan}
{key: G#m}

{c: Verse 1}
[G#m],        Mai ye soch kar uske
[D#],        dar se Utha tha
[E] [G#m],        ke wo rok legi mana legi mujhko
[G#m] [E],        Hawao me lehrata aata tha daman
[D#] [G#m],        Ke daman pkadkar bitha legi mujhko
[C#m],        Kadam aise andaz se uth rahe the
[G#m],        Ke aawaz deke bula legi mujhko
[G#m] [B],        Magar usne na roka
[G#m],        na usne mnaya
[G#m] [B],        Na daman hi pakda
[G#m],        na mujhko bithaya
[C#],        Na aawaz hi di na wapas bulaya
[B],        Mai ahista ahista badta hi aaya
[G#m],        Yaha tak ke us se zuda ho gaya
[G#m],        Yaha tak ke us se zuda ho gaya
